      <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-royal pt-4">2. Service Execution & Staffing</h3>
      <p>We commit to deploying fully vetted, DBS-checked personnel who operate under strict health and safety protocols during agreed operational hours.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-royal pt-4">3. Governing Law</h3>
      <p>These terms and any disputes arising from service contracts are governed exclusively by the laws of England and Wales.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <%= link_to "&larr; Back to Home".html_safe, root_path, class: "text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-royal hover:text-gold transition-colors" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<%= render "footer" %>